Console clean. Now install the combined probe:
- Sample every 100ms.
- Track per NPC: aim starts (with spell+color), aim durations (start→resolve), cast gaps (between aim starts of same NPC), support intents, paralysis/freed, floating texts seen (dedup within sample window).

```js
(function(){
  if (window.__p3) return 'already';
  window.__p3 = { last: {}, aims: [], casts: {}, texts: {}, events: [], t0: performance.now() };
  setInterval(function(){
    var d = window.AO_DEBUG && window.AO_DEBUG(); if (!d) return;
    (d.texts || []).forEach(function(t){ window.__p3.texts[t] = (window.__p3.texts[t] || 0) + 1; });
    d.fighters.forEach(function(f){
      if (f.id === 'player') return;
      var prev = window.__p3.last[f.id] || {};
      var now = performance.now();
      if (f.aiming && !prev.aiming) {
        var gap = window.__p3.casts[f.id] ? Math.round(now - window.__p3.casts[f.id]) : null;
        window.__p3.casts[f.id] = now;
        window.__p3.aims.push({ id: f.id, spell: f.aimSpell, color: f.aimColor, gapSincePrevAimMs: gap });
      }
      if (!f.aiming && prev.aiming && prev.aimT) window.__p3.aims.push({ id: f.id, resolved: f.aimSpell, durMs: Math.round(now - prev.aimT) });
      if (f.aiming) prev.aimT = prev.aimT || now; else prev.aimT = null;
      // hmm duration: aimT set at first sample of aiming; resolve duration = now - firstSample ≈ dur + sampling error (≤100ms)
      if (f.immobilized > 0 && !prev.par) window.__p3.events.push({ t: +d.elapsed.toFixed(1), type: 'paralysis', id: f.id });
      if (f.immobilized === 0 && prev.par && f.alive) window.__p3.events.push({ t: +d.elapsed.toFixed(1), type: 'freed', id: f.id, held: +(d.elapsed - (prev.parT || d.elapsed)).toFixed(2) });
      if (f.immobilized > 0) prev.parT = d.elapsed;
      if (f.support) window.__p3.events.push({ t: +d.elapsed.toFixed(1), type: 'intent', id: f.id, kind: f.support.kind, ally: f.support.ally });
      prev.par = f.immobilized > 0; prev.alive = f.alive; prev.aiming = f.aiming; prev.aimSpell = f.aimSpell;
      window.__p3.last[f.id] = prev;
    });
  }, 100);
  return 'p3 on';
})()
```

Simplify duration tracking: on aim start set prev.aimStart = now; on resolve push durMs = now - prev.aimStart (sampling error ≤100ms — good enough to show variance: durations .42-.78 → measured 420-880ms range distinct from old fixed 580±100... hmm overlap. The variance check: p25/p75 spread. Old fixed .58: measured ~580-680. New: 420-880. Spread tells.

Also gapSincePrevAimMs: time between consecutive aim STARTS per NPC — should be ≥ castCd(0.9) + previous aim dur (~.4-.8) ≈ ≥1.3s typically for spell casts; melee aims gated by attackCd rand(.7-1.05)... The interval check: min gap per NPC over the run.

Wait — one flaw: castCd gates updateBots entirely, but updateNpcSupport resolve → beginNpcAim happens in updateNpcSupport regardless of aiTimer; I added castCd postpone there (task.timer=.3). After cast, castCd .9 → support aim postponed ≥.3s retries until castCd over. OK.

